<import src="../../templates/shared.wxml" />
<view class="page">
  <view class="heading">四款饼干放在一起</view>
  <view class="subtitle">DEMO-0001 至 DEMO-0004 · 每 100 克 · 不做份量换算</view>
  <view class="card conclusion-card">
    <view class="card-title">对比结论</view>
    <view class="conclusion-text">{{conclusion}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="name-list">
    <view wx:for="{{foods}}" wx:key="id">{{item.shortName}}：{{item.name}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="compare-table">
    <view class="compare-row compare-head">
      <view class="row-label">营养素</view>
      <view class="compare-cell" wx:for="{{foods}}" wx:key="id">{{item.shortName}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="compare-row" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="key">
      <view class="row-label">{{item.label}}<text class="table-unit">{{item.unit}}</text></view>
      <view class="compare-cell" wx:for="{{item.cells}}" wx:for-item="cell" wx:key="id">
        <view class="cell-grade {{cell.depthClass}}">
          <view class="cell-number">{{cell.value}}</view>
          <view class="cell-level" wx:if="{{cell.graded}}">{{cell.depthText}}</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="compare-row allergens-row">
      <view class="row-label">致敏原</view>
      <view class="compare-cell allergen-cell" wx:for="{{foods}}" wx:key="id">{{item.allergenText}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <template is="legend" />
  <view class="card threshold-card">
    <view class="card-title">橙色深浅怎么看？</view>
    <view class="threshold-line"><text>钠</text><text>≤120 浅橙 / ≥800 深橙（mg）</text></view>
    <view class="threshold-line"><text>糖</text><text>≤5 浅橙 / ≥15 深橙（g）</text></view>
    <view class="threshold-line"><text>脂肪</text><text>≤3 浅橙 / ≥20 深橙（g）</text></view>
    <view class="threshold-line"><text>蛋白质</text><text>≥12 浅橙 / 小于 6 深橙（g）</text></view>
    <view class="muted small">介于两端之间为中橙。高钠、低钠、高糖、低糖、高脂、高蛋白依据 GB 28050-2025 含量声称条件。脂肪 ≤3 g、蛋白质小于 6 g 用来补齐三档。</view>
    <view class="scale-note">仅供参考，不构成食品优劣评价</view>
  </view>
  <template is="footer" />
</view>
